  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 10 December 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPicture this: sweeping, uninterrupted sea views from the moment you wake. From the living areas to the indulgent master suite, the views are simply breathtaking, an ever-changing panorama of sea and sky that makes every day extraordinary.\r\n\r\nHomes like this in Mairangi Bay are rarely offered. Tucked away in a peaceful, private setting just moments from the village, this exceptional home has been extensively renovated to the highest standard. It blends modern luxury and generous living with the coastal lifestyle so many dream of.\r\n\r\nAt its heart is a spacious contemporary kitchen, designed for family life and easy entertaining. Expansive decks with louvre systems on two levels flow from the interior, so you can dine outdoors in any season, and the landscaped gardens offer sunny, tranquil places to unwind.\r\n\r\nPracticality is equally impressive, with excellent storage space, off-street parking, a double internal-access garage, and a carport providing ample options.\r\n\r\nCafés, boutique shops, the golden sands of Mairangi Bay Beach and top schools are all within easy reach. Zoning includes Rangitoto College and Westlake Girls’ and Boys’ High Schools.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are few and far between. This is a home where exceptional views, thoughtful design, and an unbeatable location come together to offer an outstanding lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss your chance, call today to arrange your private viewing.",
